      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Crossover - write 5, render 1\nThe writer produces 5 scenes with Claude choosing each duration. **H3 Scene Pick** collapses the list to one scene by `index` (0-based) so only that clip renders; its `duration` drives the frame count.\n\nThe writer's `seed` is **fixed** so its output is cached, and `index` is driven by a PrimitiveInt on **increment**: set the Run button's batch count to 5 (or use auto-queue) and each queued run renders the next scene without calling Claude again."
      ],
      "title": "How this works",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
